cing_booth, direction, location), Direction steps, InteractionListener/Commands registration, WeaponInterface, FriendsListInterface, spellbook 192, no familiar or autocast, ServerConstants (CONFIG_PATH, SERVER_NAME, PLAYER_STOCK_CLEAR_INTERVAL, PLAYER_STOCK_RECIRCULATE from the case), and an inventory listener that records update slots and refreshes. Modelled in Support.java: the tail of processIfAction (component lookup, hidden check, ButtonClickEvent, InterfaceListeners.run, plugin), the InputPromptResponse branch around RunScript.processInput, the NPC listener choice (id-specific before option-only), the worker's per-tick order (tick listener, then GameWorld.pulse, skipped when the listener throws), and logout as InterfaceManager.close then closeSingleTab. Not exercised: InteractionListeners dispatch and walking to the NPC, the command bodies, the real InventoryListener, GameMessage bytes and the real item cache (definitions are authored inputs, including those for the pinned rows).",
